  "solution": {
    "text": "For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup></math><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>Q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>8</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>Q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>8</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8713;</mo><mi>Q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is not transitive.</p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8713;</mo><mi>Q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8713;</mo><mi>Q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>Q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3